cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, data, or the accompanying papers, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "Boundary Programme: machine-checked boundary potential and level identification"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 development tree for the Boundary Programme. The unified audit body has
  56 files, 467 theorems/lemmas and 90 definitions, with 0 sorry and no custom
  axioms. It contains (A) the A-module boundary-potential evidence, including the
  machine-checked C_H = pi^2/3 chain, and (B) the formal spine for closure fixed
  points, level non-intrinsicality (weak form), identification, and the readout
  bound theta* = 2/(1+e). The paper B canonical subset is 53 files / 417
  theorems/lemmas / 77 definitions. Papers are preprints, not peer-reviewed.
